# Google Maps JavaScript API key (enable "Maps JavaScript API" and "Places API (New)")
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your key.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Backend API base URL.
# - Leave unset for local dev: requests go to /api/v1 and Vite proxies
#   /api → http://localhost:8080 (see vite.config.ts).
# - Set for staging/prod, e.g. VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com/api/v1
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
